k rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/21-101.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Anbiyaa 21:101 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sungguh, bagi orang-orang yang telah ada (ketetapan) yang baik dari Kami sebelumnya, mereka itu akan dijauhkan (dari neraka).\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/21-101.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Tafsir al-Syaikhain\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon-192.png\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Tafsir Al-Anbiyaa 21:101 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\", \"description\": \"Sungguh, bagi orang-orang yang telah ada (ketetapan) yang baik dari Kami sebelumnya, mereka itu akan dijauhkan (dari neraka).\", \"inLanguage\": \"id\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/21-101.html\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/21-101.html\", \"image\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah\"}, {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Imam Ibnul Qayyim\"}], \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"Tafsir al-Syaikhain\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Anbiyaa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/21.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 101\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/21-101.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}.langs{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}.langs a{color:var(--lapis)}</style>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ER9F5C2HC1\"></script>\n<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-ER9F5C2HC1',{allow_google_signals:false,allow_ad_personalization_signals:false});</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/21.html\">Surah Al-Anbiyaa</a> › Ayat 101</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:101</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ سَبَقَتْ لَهُم مِّنَّا الْحُسْنَىٰ أُولَٰئِكَ عَنْهَا مُبْعَدُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sungguh, bagi orang-orang yang telah ada (ketetapan) yang baik dari Kami sebelumnya, mereka itu akan dijauhkan (dari neraka).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فمن سبقت له من الله الحسنى: فلا بد أن يصير مؤمنا تقيا فمن لم يكن من المؤمنين لم يسبق له من الله حسنى ولكن إذا سبقت للعبد من الله سابقة استعمله بالعمل الذي يصل به إلى تلك السابقة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/266</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا الإيراد الذي أورده ابن الزبعري لا يرد على الآية فإنه سبحانه قال إنكم وما تعبدون من دون الله ولم يقل ومن تعبدون<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/27</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s21a101\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/21-99.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (21:99)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/21-104.html\">Ayat berikutnya (21:104)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <a href=\"/en/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" data-l=\"en\">English</a> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <b lang=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</b> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">فارسی</a> · <a href=\"/ru/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\" data-l=\"ru\">Русский</a> · <a href=\"/sw/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"sw\" lang=\"sw\" data-l=\"sw\">Kiswahili</a> · <a href=\"/ha/ayah/21-101.html\" hreflang=\"ha\" lang=\"ha\" d